/E (Design and simulate a 1:8 Demultiplexer using Verilog HDL. The circuit should accept a single 1-bit data input and a 3-bit select input and route the input signal to one of eight output lines based on the select input. Create a testbench that demonstrates all possible select combinations and verifies the corresponding output. Explain the working principle of the demultiplexer and verify the functionality using simulation in Vivado.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
